  lead: 'Job chhor kar apna business shuru karna ek bara faisla hai, aur is faisle ka asar aapke us saal ke tax return par bhi parta hai. Aadhe saal ki salary aik jagah se, aur baqi aadhe saal ki business income doosri jagah se — dono ko ek hi return mein sahi tarah jama karna zaroori hai. Jo log yeh sochte hain ke "job wala hissa to already tax kat gaya, ab bas business wala dikha dena hai," woh aksar galat calculation kar baithte hain. Is guide mein hum poora practical process dekhenge.',
