  lead: 'Bohat se overseas Pakistanis ek din mustaqil tor par Pakistan wapas aane ka faisla karte hain — job khatam, ghar wapas, ya retirement ka waqt. Jis saal yeh switch hota hai, uska tax return doosre saalon se mukhtalif hota hai, kyunke aapki residency status saal ke darmiyan badalti hai. Yeh guide bataegi ke is transition wale saal ka return kaise banta hai aur kya dhyan rakhna zaroori hai.',
