  faqHeading: 'Agricultural Income Aur Federal Return — Aksar Poochay Jane Wale Sawalat',
  lead: 'Bohat se log jinke paas salary ya business income ke sath khandani zameen se agricultural income bhi hai, is baat mein confuse rehte hain ke apne federal tax return mein agricultural income ka kya karein. Kya usay dikhana hai? Kya us par tax lagega? Is guide mein hum specifically is combination — agricultural income + doosri income — ka federal return ke lehaaz se treatment dekhte hain.',
